# Discover, the app store, with Flatpak and Snap as app sources.
# Flathub is added by hook 9200-add-flathub-remote.hook.chroot from
# includes.chroot/etc/flatpak/remotes.d/flathub.flatpakrepo, and Discover
# prefers Flatpak for apps that exist in several sources
# (includes.chroot/etc/xdg/discoverrc).
plasma-discover
plasma-discover-backend-flatpak
plasma-discover-backend-snap
flatpak
snapd
# The Flatpak permissions page in System Settings
kde-config-flatpak
